      {
        "id": "model-trace-summary",
        "moduleId": "after-if-flow",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "summary",
        "title": "模型补充：一次完整执行路径",
        "markdown": "以 `number = 23` 为例，一次猜数运行可以拆成四步：\n\n1. 读取用户输入，转换成整数并存入 `guess`。\n2. 求值 `guess == number`：为真则执行成功分支并跳过 `elif`、`else`；为假则继续求值 `guess < number`。\n3. 若 `guess < number` 为真，提示猜一个更大的数；否则进入 `else` 分支。\n4. 整个 `if` 语句结束后，继续执行 `print('Done')`。\n\n无论命中哪条分支，第 4 步都会执行，因为 `print('Done')` 与 `if` 语句处于同一缩进级别。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-after-if",
            "textbook-compare-branch"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-transfer-check",
        "moduleId": "check-and-transfer",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "检查：判断执行路径与输出",
        "markdown": "阅读下面的代码，写出 `guess` 分别为 23、10、30 时的输出，并说明哪一步之后程序会执行 `print('Done')`：\n\n```python\nnumber = 23\nguess = int(input('Enter an integer: '))\nif guess == number:\n    print('Congratulations, you guessed it.')\nelif guess < number:\n    print('No, it is a little higher than that.')\nelse:\n    print('No, it is a little lower than that.')\nprint('Done')\n```\n\n作答时请指出每条输入命中了哪个分支，以及命中的分支如何影响后续语句的执行位置。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "model-trace-summary",
            "textbook-elif-optional"
          ]
        }
      }
